DESCRIPTION: | Arena Wien - Dreiraum | 19:00 doors 20:00 Pressure Drop 21:00 Mess  Mess sind eine mexikanische Punk./Oi!-Band mit startkem 82er UK-Einschlag. https://messtheterribles.bandcamp.com/  Vienna based Pressure Drop are a musical onslaught on the ears with their own blend of stomping HC/punk\, Streetpunk and Oi! Capeet Records has just released their first raw and uncompromising tape and they are eager to unleash their fury onto the world once more. Brace yourself\, you have been warned! https://pressure-drop.bandcamp.com  Vorverkauf/Presale Arena Shop € 18 (+ € 1\,98 Fee)  Abendkassa/Box-office € 22
